{"2614150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Privateer", "steam_appid": 2614150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/1dcdf5b2e4d2e04f74f3d14c73bbc453.poster.avif?t=1776348786\" width=600 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/1dcdf5b2e4d2e04f74f3d14c73bbc453.webm?t=1776348786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/1dcdf5b2e4d2e04f74f3d14c73bbc453.mp4?t=1776348786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You have escaped from slavery on a mining asteroid and find yourself in an unfamiliar and hostile Sector. All you have is a stolen spaceship, a few fellows, and a boarding saber. Now, you must rely solely on yourself and carve out a new destiny for yourself in this vast and unforgiving universe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NON-LINEAR STORYTELLING</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/909300ea6a403ee47d188f8220c05e98.poster.avif?t=1776348786\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/909300ea6a403ee47d188f8220c05e98.webm?t=1776348786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/909300ea6a403ee47d188f8220c05e98.mp4?t=1776348786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Become a privateer in the service of one of the Sector’s warring factions. Take on thrilling missions, complete contracts, help people, or use them.<br>Explore the vast and dangerous landscape of the Sector. Uncover hidden treasures and the secrets of this war-torn world. <br>The path you choose will define not only your own legacy but also the legacy of the Sector itself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPACE BATTLES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/3c0d6dae983b29a2219b552679032dd2.poster.avif?t=1776348786\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/3c0d6dae983b29a2219b552679032dd2.webm?t=1776348786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/3c0d6dae983b29a2219b552679032dd2.mp4?t=1776348786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Buy new spaceships and adjust them. Hire a crew. Upgrade and modify your equipment. Then, engage in thrilling epic space battles against enemy ships and space stations!<br>Isn’t that enough? Gather a squadron to overpower your enemies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPEN SPACE SHOOTOUTS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/a8333e3332c20cf91d0c8288b28ac881.poster.avif?t=1776348786\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/a8333e3332c20cf91d0c8288b28ac881.webm?t=1776348786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/a8333e3332c20cf91d0c8288b28ac881.mp4?t=1776348786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Control your ship or go boarding during the intense cosmic battles. Engage in close combat action and fearlessly confront your enemies face to face. Navigate through their ships, damage their defenses, and seize control. Plunder the valuable treasures in their holds and use them to build your empire. The choices are yours!", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/1dcdf5b2e4d2e04f74f3d14c73bbc453.poster.avif?t=1776348786\" width=600 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/1dcdf5b2e4d2e04f74f3d14c73bbc453.webm?t=1776348786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/1dcdf5b2e4d2e04f74f3d14c73bbc453.mp4?t=1776348786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You have escaped from slavery on a mining asteroid and find yourself in an unfamiliar and hostile Sector. All you have is a stolen spaceship, a few fellows, and a boarding saber. Now, you must rely solely on yourself and carve out a new destiny for yourself in this vast and unforgiving universe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NON-LINEAR STORYTELLING</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/909300ea6a403ee47d188f8220c05e98.poster.avif?t=1776348786\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/909300ea6a403ee47d188f8220c05e98.webm?t=1776348786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614150/extras/909300ea6a403ee47d188f8220c05e98.mp4?t=1776348786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Become a privateer in the service of one of the Sector’s warring factions. Take on thrilling missions, complete contracts, help people, or use them.<br>Explore the vast and dangerous landscape of the Sector. Uncover hidden treasures and the secrets of this war-torn world. <br>The path you choose will define not only your own legacy but also the legacy of th